			<div class="content" id="post-content-1852108">
									

<p>I kinda like this. The actual SCP is pretty much a framing device for a story told in the addenda, and that's something I've used before to strong effect.</p>
<p>The dialogue could stand to be a little stronger, though. That &quot;Jenny from the block&quot; comment sailed over my head; yeah, I get the reference, but it was so out-of-the-blue that I thought the SCP was affecting his mind.</p>
<p>At its core, this is another commentary of the Foundation as one of the least ethical prison systems on its planet, and while these are going to pop up until the site's perception of his humanoid containment works&#8230; I don't know. I would hope the Foundation could find a sane way around that.</p>

